\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 ***** FOLDER: DATASETS *****
\b0 \
\
Contains all the data that can be downloaded at once.\
This folder also contains a summary MS Excel file that will be updated if something changes in the data (but old copies are also available).\
More information is available on: http://www.projectmanagement.ugent.be/research/data/RanGen\
\

\b ***** FOLDER: RESULTS *****
\b0 \
\
1. Folder BKS.zip\
\
This is the folder that will be updated regularly with new BKS (results file) and dataset files when new solutions arrive.\
\
2. Folder Vanhoucke and Coelho Paper.zip\
\
This folder contains all the dataset files and results files from the paper \'93Testing and validating algorithms for resource-constrained project scheduling\'94. In this paper, the tool SolutionsUpdate is presented for the very first time. This folder will never be updated with new results, and must be used for illustrative purposes (repeating the experiments of the paper to learn how SolutionsUpdate works).\
\

\b ***** FOLDER: TUTORIALS *****
\b0 \
\
Contains the tutorials for SolutionsUpdate, as written on the website and in the paper.\
\

\b ***** FOLDER: TOOL *****
\b0 \
\
This folder contains the tool SolutionsUpdate (both command line and GUI versions) for windows and for MAC OSX.\
\

\b ***** FOLDER: MOVIES *****
\b0 \
\
The movies are uploaded to YouTube (see links below)\
\
MOVIE 1. SolutionsUpdate (Short Version): Upload and share new project scheduling solutions \
\
Learn how to use SolutionsUpdate to upload best known solutions for resource-constrained project scheduling problems. This is the short version of the video tutorial (3 minutes) and a longer version (14 minutes) is also available. The SolutionsUpdate tool, the project data, more tutorials, and much more, can be downloaded from www.projectmanagement.ugent.be/research/data.\
